{
 "duration": 222.278,
 "parts": [
  {
   "seg": 0,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "小朋友们好！今天要学的单词，听起来就很温暖。",
   "t0": 0.4,
   "t1": 5.054,
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 0,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "family",
   "t0": 5.304,
   "t1": 5.867,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 0,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "意思是，家庭，一家人。",
   "t0": 6.367,
   "t1": 8.683,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 1,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "爸爸、妈妈和你，住在同一个屋檐下，就组成了一个家。家庭，英语叫",
   "t0": 9.533,
   "t1": 16.221,
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:family",
    "focus:family"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 1,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "family",
   "t0": 16.471,
   "t1": 17.034,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 1,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This is my family.",
   "t0": 17.534,
   "t1": 18.719,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 2,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "先来认识家里每天照顾你的人，妈妈。妈妈，正式一点的说法是",
   "t0": 19.819,
   "t1": 25.653,
   "cue": [
    "show:mother",
    "focus:mother"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 2,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "mother",
   "t0": 25.903,
   "t1": 26.382,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 2,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "在家里，我们更常亲切地叫她",
   "t0": 26.882,
   "t1": 29.474,
   "cue": [
    "alt:mother"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 2,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "mom",
   "t0": 29.724,
   "t1": 30.137,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 2,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I love you, Mom!",
   "t0": 30.637,
   "t1": 31.997,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 3,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "再来看看爸爸。爸爸，正式一点的说法是",
   "t0": 33.097,
   "t1": 37.029,
   "cue": [
    "show:father",
    "focus:father"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 3,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "father",
   "t0": 37.279,
   "t1": 37.755,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 3,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "平时叫爸爸，就说",
   "t0": 38.255,
   "t1": 40.052,
   "cue": [
    "alt:father"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 3,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "dad",
   "t0": 40.302,
   "t1": 40.747,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 3,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Good morning, Dad!",
   "t0": 41.247,
   "t1": 42.584,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 4,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "妈妈和爸爸合在一起，就是父母：",
   "t0": 43.684,
   "t1": 46.441,
   "cue": [
    "show:parents",
    "edge:mother>parents",
    "edge:father>parents",
    "focus:parents"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 4,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "parents",
   "t0": 46.691,
   "t1": 47.275,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 4,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "父母是两个人，所以这个单词的最后，有一个字母 s。",
   "t0": 47.775,
   "t1": 52.564,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 4,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Mom and Dad are my parents.",
   "t0": 52.814,
   "t1": 54.467,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 5,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "爸爸妈妈最疼爱的小宝贝，就是孩子。孩子，英语是",
   "t0": 55.567,
   "t1": 60.843,
   "cue": [
    "show:child",
    "edge:mother>child",
    "edge:father>child",
    "focus:child"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 5,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "child",
   "t0": 61.093,
   "t1": 61.57,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 5,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I am a child.",
   "t0": 62.07,
   "t1": 62.966,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 6,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "孩子还有一个更轻松、更口语的说法：",
   "t0": 64.066,
   "t1": 66.991,
   "cue": [
    "show:kid",
    "edge:child>kid",
    "focus:kid"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 6,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "kid",
   "t0": 67.241,
   "t1": 67.613,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 6,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "意思差不多，平时聊天的时候，大家特别爱用它。",
   "t0": 68.113,
   "t1": 72.236,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 6,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Hi, kids!",
   "t0": 72.486,
   "t1": 73.627,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 7,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "如果这个孩子是女孩，对爸爸妈妈来说，她就是女儿：",
   "t0": 74.727,
   "t1": 79.152,
   "cue": [
    "show:daughter",
    "edge:child>daughter",
    "focus:daughter"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 7,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "daughter",
   "t0": 79.402,
   "t1": 79.891,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 7,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "小提示：中间的两个字母 g 和 h，是不发音的。",
   "t0": 80.391,
   "t1": 84.895,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 7,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She is their daughter.",
   "t0": 85.145,
   "t1": 86.176,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 8,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "如果是男孩，他就是儿子：",
   "t0": 87.276,
   "t1": 89.451,
   "cue": [
    "show:son",
    "edge:child>son",
    "focus:son"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 8,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "son",
   "t0": 89.701,
   "t1": 90.215,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 8,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "He is their son.",
   "t0": 90.715,
   "t1": 91.768,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 9,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "一家人在一起，每天都会做很多暖暖的事。下面再学三个动作单词。",
   "t0": 92.868,
   "t1": 99.367,
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 10,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "我们还小，吃饭、穿衣、上学，很多事都要靠爸爸妈妈帮忙。依靠，英语是",
   "t0": 100.217,
   "t1": 108.014,
   "cue": [
    "show:depend",
    "focus:depend,child,parents"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 10,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "depend",
   "t0": 108.264,
   "t1": 108.856,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 10,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "依靠谁，后面常常跟一个小词",
   "t0": 109.356,
   "t1": 112.171,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 10,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "on",
   "t0": 112.421,
   "t1": 112.825,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 10,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Kids depend on their parents.",
   "t0": 113.325,
   "t1": 115.036,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 11,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "晚上睡觉前，妈妈会在你的脸上轻轻亲一下。亲吻，英语是",
   "t0": 116.136,
   "t1": 122.274,
   "cue": [
    "show:kiss",
    "focus:kiss,mother,kid"
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": 11,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "kiss",
   "t0": 122.524,
   "t1": 122.992,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 11,
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Give Mom a kiss.",
   "t0": 123.492,
   "t1": 124.595,
   "cue": []
  },
  {
   "seg": 12,
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "爸爸去外地工作了，想他的时候怎么办？给他打个电话吧！打电话，英语是",
   "t0": 125.695,
   "t1": 132.919,
   "cue": [
    "show:call",
    "focus:call,father,son"
   ]
  },
